# to the repo root, they only apply to data/ and config/ themselves.
# demo/ intentionally holds fictional equivalents, committed for the public demo.)

# Market price cache (market_data.py): regenerated automatically
data/cache/

# demo/: only the "source" files (CSV + config) are committed — the price
# cache and normalized journal a local run regenerates there are not.
demo/data/cache/
demo/data/processed/

# Local working notes for Claude Code (personal runbooks, not project docs)
.claude/

# UI-work screenshot sweeps (scripts/review_shots.py): working images used to
# diff a change against a baseline, not deliverables. The published ones live
# in docs/screenshots/.
.review-shots/
